{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"screens\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把“不想往后”理解成“不再急着退缩”，实际强调的是不愿考虑未来，只想停留在当下的亲近中。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把“怕对方为难”部分解释成“没有勇气”，实际不是单纯缺乏胆量，而是顾虑对方感受，主动保留了一部分心意。对这一屏逐渐紧绷、亲近变得脆弱的感受也有所遗漏。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"无。处境和原因基本准确，但把复杂的内心矛盾概括成安心、期待和忐忑，遗漏了白天亲近、夜晚酸楚，以及身体感受、遗憾与快感交织的部分。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"无。互相需要、互相依靠以及希望对方记得自己都理解正确，但感受部分遗漏了身体与情色暖意、遗憾和快感交织，以及美好时光仍在流逝的意味。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把“开始盼两人能这样好很久”说成“开始相信两人可以一直这样好”，稍微提高了他的信心程度。原文强调的是有期待却心里没底，而非已经开始相信能够长久。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"无。害怕不再被需要、害怕相处变得不自在的理解正确，但遗漏了一个重要的另一面：两人此刻仍然亲近，他也猜想对方或许喜欢自己在身边。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"无。让对方安心、不再收着喜欢、想多陪一会儿以及不强求未来保证，都理解正确。但感受概括得较为平和，遗漏了自我退到后面、恳求般的不满足，以及近乎高烧般的狂喜和不愿松手的强烈情绪。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S14\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"story\": 4,\n  \"story_note\": \"全曲主线完全一致：从小心翼翼地靠近、害怕成为负担，到发现对方仍愿亲近甚至可能需要自己，再到享受当下、坦然表达喜欢，最终接受未来无法保证而决定不再隐藏心意；观众主要省略了部分感官体验、内心矛盾和情绪层次，但没有拼成另一段故事。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6529fc5a-d8ef-479e-bc5b-2ba8a943c64d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T125842555215Z", "elapsed_seconds": 172.625, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T13:01:35.196883+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1f6917d84d465311c0e60e3b26a2afa06d03fd90c0f606130f99e05082914970", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T125842555215Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "9005cd52286c92053d8e681d579adf2043ce28257e3a2414bba39c4748c3e9e3"}}}
